Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.95,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We've finally got our stolen coords back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.95,0:00:05.55,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Isn't that great?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:06.84,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's snap! Let's snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:07.91,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.41,0:00:12.15,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,This is the entertainment news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.56,0:00:17.84,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,Internationally famous movie star and winner of the title best prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:22.05,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,Shikyouin Hibiki-san, has revealed that she is actually a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.01,0:01:57.85,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The Fabulous Daily Life of Shikyouin Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.02,0:02:04.77,Default-Alt,Announcer,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san has made her idol début at PriPara, the female only idol themeworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.77,0:02:08.44,Default-Alt,Announcer,0,0,0,,For fans of hers in EuroPara, Pamerica, Aprica, Pasia,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.44,0:02:13.64,Default,Announcer,0,0,0,,and others around the world, this has come as a big shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:19.01,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:20.06,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Keep it coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:22.04,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,That's great, Hibiki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.25,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I've taken the Tears of Yuliya as promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:27.29,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now good day, gentlemen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.61,0:02:28.63,Default,Director,0,0,0,,And cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:37.60,Default,Reporter1,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:39.06,Default,Reporter1,0,0,0,,A word for your fans!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:41.06,Default,Reporter2,0,0,0,,Why have you disguised yourself as a man?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:42.41,Default,Reporter3,0,0,0,,Are you really a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.37,Default,Reporter4,0,0,0,,Why did you make your PriPara début now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:47.36,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,My PriPara début?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.57,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You've got it backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.87,0:02:52.84,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,PriPara has finally met Shikyouin Hibiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.84,0:02:55.76,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You'll understand once I finish dyeing it in my colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:57.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And that will be its revolution.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.53,0:03:02.92,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,This is the third straight day that Shikyouin Hibiki has been at the top of the search team rankings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:04.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{Ohh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.36,0:03:07.01,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why is someone like her so popular?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.01,0:03:09.09,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'm way cuter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.41,0:03:11.60,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,It's probably cause she's a well known star.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:14.52,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,She also has a detailed online profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.87,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,She made her début as a male model at the age of seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.87,0:03:18.97,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And ever since then, she's been described as a prodigy young actor...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.56,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,...and has come to be known as best prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:25.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So she's been playing a boy for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:28.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But why has she been doing that despite being a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.49,0:03:35.45,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san revealed that she is Phantom Thief Genius when she made her début,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:39.33,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,and indicated that her intention is to change the face of PriPara for the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.00,0:03:41.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,In later comments,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.71,0:03:47.63,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,she mentioned that everything is dependant on the\Noutcome of the upcoming Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:50.93,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,If the team Hibiki-san puts together happens to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:53.05,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,all of her previous crimes will be overlooked,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:58.43,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,and there's a chance she'll be allowed to dictate the future of PriPara's policies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.34,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:01.80,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We'll win and force her to apologise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:02.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.28,0:04:03.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,There's no way we'll lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.16,Default,Larothy,0,0,0,,We got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:08.64,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But her concert was really impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.29,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,As were her wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.08,0:04:16.44,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}We certainly made a rash decision when she challenged us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:18.53,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:20.06,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:20.99,Default,Laroa,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:26.21,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,All of the members who Airy Changed at the Dream Theatre gained wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.46,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:29.17,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,And?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:32.13,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,...we have Manaka-san's burning inner strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:36.88,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Whenever we're in peril, she has a strange potential that manifests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:39.33,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,That time, and that other time...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:41.69,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw that power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:43.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:45.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.07,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.37,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And on top of that, we're hard working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:53.49,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,"Genius is 1% talent and 99% percent hard work" {\fscx200}-{\r} Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.49,0:04:55.44,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,If they come at us with a team of prodigies,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.44,0:04:58.41,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,we'll be fine with an average team that is hard working!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:04:59.48,Default,Laroa,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.48,0:05:00.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.85,0:05:02.05,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:04.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Actually, where are Sophie-san and Shion-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:05.52,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Haven't a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.52,0:05:07.39,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Didn't they have something come up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:13.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Please pardon my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:17.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I have a boring party I must attend shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:19.78,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Why did you call us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:20.43,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.41,0:05:28.39,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As I'm sure you know, I'm forming a team of prodigies for the upcoming WinDrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:31.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Houjou Sophie, Toudou Shion,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:35.11,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I am formally inviting you to join my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:41.78,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The looks on your faces tell me that you are unsure of how to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:43.40,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,But it's simple if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.00,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You just need to be honest with yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:47.20,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:50.17,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You saw my concert, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:53.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And the sparkle of my wings as I flew...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:59.39,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm sure you thought "I also want to try putting on a flying concert like that".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:00.31,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.22,0:06:03.42,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,A prodigy knows a prodigy when she sees one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.67,0:06:09.41,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As we're prodigies, a reaction unlike anything anyone has ever seen will take place as we sing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.87,0:06:14.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And then we'll be able to witness a scene no one has seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:18.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,A scene no one has seen before?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.55,0:06:20.38,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I understand what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:22.30,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,But your comments are useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.30,0:06:24.22,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I've decided to do things my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:25.53,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:28.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll join me eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:38.21,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.99,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Something like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:42.16,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,0,,{alt}Pushuu~.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.64,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm swimming along thinking I'm a jellyfish,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:47.35,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,then she says "you are a mushroom",
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:49.78,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,even though I'm a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.78,0:06:53.38,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Then are cloud ear mushrooms jellyfish? Or mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.47,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,That kind of feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.85,0:06:58.44,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I can't relate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:08.37,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Arresting Phantom Thief Genius is entirely dependent upon the outcome of the WinDrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.67,0:07:12.96,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It's unfortunate that we weren't able to achieve anything as the PriPara Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:16.84,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,As of today, the special investigation team is being disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.84,0:07:19.55,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Degas!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.82,0:07:23.06,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,How deeply regrettable-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:26.76,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I will be returning to my normal job of supporting the idols here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:29.06,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ham-senpai and the rest of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:34.15,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,please continue to protect the peace within this town as part of the PriPara Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.15,0:07:35.15,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Poan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:36.05,Default,Pandas,0,0,0,,Pan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.86,0:07:39.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Here's your SummDrea ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.40,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.59,0:07:44.20,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're doing better than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:49.58,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}It must have been quite a shock to find out the guy she admired was actually a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:53.12,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Get better soon so we can perform together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.35,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All right, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:31.39,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,How are you doing, Fuwari-tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.39,0:08:32.24,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.79,0:08:34.93,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It was quite the shock, wasn't it-tori?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:39.52,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Since Toriko is your manager, you ended up getting hurt-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:42.21,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,That means Toriko is a terrible manager-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.48,0:08:43.76,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.76,0:08:44.92,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I love you, Toriko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:47.50,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Then please listen to Toriko's request-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:51.48,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Please go outside and get a breath of fresh air soon-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:52.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:55.85,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Andou?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.31,0:08:58.84,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I have a half hour gap in my schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.84,0:09:00.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Is my horse ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:03.07,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,My apologies, Hibiki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:07.23,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,Maxi actually jumped over the high school riding club's fence...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:24.71,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Maxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:27.93,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Did you come to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.87,0:09:32.94,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm glad I came outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.31,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Maxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.23,0:09:45.90,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I told you not to come here, did I not?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.05,0:09:48.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,All right, let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.36,0:09:52.90,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:57.19,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm, um... shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:00.13,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Not only are you Phantom Thief Genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:03.43,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,but you're also a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.80,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I understand you even less now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:10.51,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You've told me so many things.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:14.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But which parts were true and which were lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.95,0:10:17.93,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As if I'd lie to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:18.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:25.57,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Fuwari, I was only ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:27.53,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,...in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:33.60,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Did you take that seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:34.16,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:38.29,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,To me, a performance like this is an everyday thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.29,0:10:41.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's easy to trick a country girl from the Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:45.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Would you like me to whisper more passionate words in your ear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.45,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.93,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,She's in bed again-tori?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.93,0:11:01.16,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It must be Toriko's fault-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:07.92,Default,Reporter1,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san, are you planing on continuing your career as a girl from here on out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.92,0:11:11.11,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll continue doing things the way I want just like I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.49,0:11:17.16,Default,Reporter1,0,0,0,,I heard that you are playing the role of a girl dressed as a guy in your next movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:19.58,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We've already started rehearsals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.96,0:11:22.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I hope all of you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.54,0:11:23.71,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,For crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.71,0:11:26.00,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I've heard enough about Hibiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.45,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why aren't they going on about Dorothy this and Dorothy that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:31.19,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I have something I'd like to ask you, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.19,0:11:32.42,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:36.51,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Hibiki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:39.01,Default,Director,0,0,0,,You're a beautiful hunk again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:41.56,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Well, this time you're a Knight of Persailles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.56,0:11:45.48,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Who would have thought this would be the perfect movie for you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.48,0:11:47.98,Default,Director,0,0,0,,You're going to gain more fans again, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.37,0:11:49.38,Default,2,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.38,0:11:57.12,Default,2,0,0,0,,It seems we'll be starting late as the flight for Barazono Yuri-san, our heroine, has been delayed about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.12,0:11:57.69,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.69,0:12:00.17,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Even if she did win a Parademy Award,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.17,0:12:03.23,Default,Director,0,0,0,,she's a bitch for making Hibiki-chan wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.23,0:12:04.00,Default,2,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.00,0:12:04.98,Default,2,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:07.29,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Hibiki-chan, please be a darling and wait an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:09.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I am not used to waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.22,0:12:10.21,Default,2,0,0,0,,{Eh?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:12.49,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Reschedule the rehearsal for another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.49,0:12:14.10,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Wait, Hibiki-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:15.88,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.88,0:12:18.35,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.84,Default-Alt,?,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.29,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Dorothy West,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}and her younger brother Leona West...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.04,0:12:24.73,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}What are they up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.17,0:12:33.79,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,{tch!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.79,0:12:36.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,And here I thought we could sneak in and surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.91,Default,?,0,0,0,,Do you know these people, Shikyouin-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:40.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Nope. Please toss them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:43.99,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Eh? That's not nice, Mage-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.99,0:12:45.21,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:48.33,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Why do you dress up like a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:53.40,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That's what I wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:55.76,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I wanted to see what you're normally like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:12:59.04,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Leona West...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.36,0:13:02.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's said that the goddesses of PriPara have made exception for this idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:05.14,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}He doesn't look the least bit manly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:08.15,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But he did chase my smash once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.48,0:13:10.84,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Cheer up, Hibiki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:13.59,Default,Director,0,0,0,,The programme after this needs you Hibiki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.59,0:13:14.61,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:15.74,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.74,0:13:18.11,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,However, it would be boring to just wait around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.11,0:13:18.82,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:23.04,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Why don't we use a stand-in until my co-star arrives?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.79,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Huh? A stand-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:26.54,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.54,0:13:27.21,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.21,0:13:28.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.19,0:13:32.63,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll answer your question if you be our stand-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.63,0:13:34.09,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.50,0:13:40.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As I said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:43.80,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,this rehearsal is for practice and to check lighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.56,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,so you just need to match the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:49.17,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Now let's have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:53.02,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Okay, "Knight of Persailles" act 2, scene 2,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.02,0:13:56.24,Default,Director,0,0,0,,the scene where our knight rescues the princess from the pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:57.61,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:14:00.58,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why am I dressed like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.32,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why am I the pirate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:04.15,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,There's no way there's a pirate cuter than me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.69,0:14:06.55,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Cut it out! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:08.55,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.41,0:14:12.08,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Princess, I am glad thou art safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:16.80,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I hath travelled these stormy seas upon the call to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.01,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I will not let thee pass into the hands of these pirates!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.08,0:14:24.50,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,W-Why have you come?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.50,0:14:26.60,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Flee while you still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:30.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And leave you in this place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.91,0:14:33.52,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I would rather throw myself to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.73,Default,Director,0,0,0,,And now the pirate's line!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.73,0:14:37.38,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.38,0:14:38.91,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The princess is escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.91,0:14:41.00,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.73,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,...what's with this line?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:44.45,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Bring out the director and screenwriter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:46.47,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We're out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:47.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Here, take my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:52.88,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.84,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Because I know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:00.78,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Your true side... your false love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.05,0:15:03.80,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,The words you whisper with those lips...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:07.26,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,That hand you gently extend to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:11.43,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I finally understand that they're all a lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:14.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.00,Default,SubDirector,0,0,0,,That female stand in is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:18.23,Default,Director,0,0,0,,She's pretty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:19.90,Default,Director,0,0,0,,All right, your line, pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:21.70,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The princess is escaping!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.70,0:15:23.91,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:28.12,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You're actually a girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:32.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yet, why do you dress like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.31,0:15:37.87,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Why, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:41.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This world is a lie{\fscx300}-{\r}a farce{\fscx300}-{\r} you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.07,0:15:42.59,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,So what, pray tell, is the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.79,0:15:43.59,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.80,0:15:45.45,Default,SubDirector,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.45,0:15:47.81,Default,SubDirector,0,0,0,,"Due to family circumstances, I was raised as a man"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.81,0:15:49.77,Default,SubDirector,0,0,0,,...is the line she should have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.22,0:15:52.23,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.19,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,What about yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.91,0:15:57.31,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:03.45,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I'm fine as I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.69,0:16:04.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.41,0:16:07.32,Default,SubDirector,0,0,0,,That's not her line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.32,0:16:08.34,Default,SubDirector,0,0,0,,You okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.34,0:16:10.19,Default,Director,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:13.19,Default,Director,0,0,0,,I've come up with a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.72,0:16:19.39,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Even if I have to turn the heavens against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I will do anything to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:24.65,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Even if I must sacrifice myself, My Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:28.40,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing to Leona?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.16,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Dorothy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:33.31,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Hey, don't I have a cannon or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.31,0:16:34.94,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Fire! Fire! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.13,0:16:36.48,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here, Leona.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:37.90,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I can't handle this jerk any longer{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:44.80,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Barazono-san has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:49.67,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That hurt! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.16,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming with me, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:56.81,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I thought Hibiki-san and I were the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:58.63,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,but it seems we also have our differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:16:59.83,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:01.71,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You're not obnoxious like her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.71,0:17:04.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,She's just naturally disagreeable!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:06.55,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That fraud!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:11.14,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.85,0:17:14.23,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:20.49,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,An aristocratic vampire's coord must be made up of dark and chic colours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:22.17,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It looks very good, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:23.73,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Vampire Rose Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:32.02,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,After her{With her} début concert, Hibiki-san was ranked a Celebrity Idol in Top Rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:35.79,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,and became the highest ranking idol in PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:38.71,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please look forward to another concert from this prodigy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:14.01,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.02,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:21.89,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I will protect it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.81,0:19:24.40,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Sapphire Revolution:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:27.68,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Wild Dance of Innocence!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.05,0:19:32.07,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Sacrifices must be made for the revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:37.31,Default,Hibiki,0,0,70,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.06,0:19:43.71,Default,Hibiki,0,0,70,,Golden Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:20.03,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Hibiki-san is yellow; Celebrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:21.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It fits her perfectly, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.18,0:20:23.60,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.60,0:20:25.83,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A scene never seen before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.18,0:20:27.72,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,I'll definitely beat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.72,0:20:29.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.84,0:20:32.05,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,We're all here with you, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.34,0:20:33.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.95,0:20:35.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,As long as we're together, we can't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:38.26,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,She may be formidable, but we'll definitely win-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:39.60,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.23,0:22:18.65,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Whether to join Shikyouin's team or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.65,0:22:20.95,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A quick decision must be made!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.15,0:22:24.95,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What kind of scenery did she mean by a scene no one has seen before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.95,0:22:27.20,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,The answer exists within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.20,0:22:28.03,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.03,0:22:29.89,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go'ing My Way!
